# semdev environment configuration
# Copy to .env and fill in what you need:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The Taskfile loads .env automatically (dotenv: ['.env']); a variable already
# exported in your shell wins over the .env value. .env is gitignored — the
# key must NEVER appear in a config file, test source, or commit (the model
# registry reads it at resolve time via api_key_env).

# ─── LLM provider keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gemini — the paid provider for real-LLM runs (docs/real-llm-runbook.md).
# Required by: task realllm:probe / realllm:launch.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
